    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Umwami Manase akora ibyangwa n'Uwiteka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manase yimye amaze imyaka cumi n'ibiri avutse, amara imyaka mirongo itanu i Yerusalemu ari ku ngoma. Nyina yitwaga Hefusiba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.15.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 15.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ariko akora ibyangwa n'Uwiteka, akurikiza ibizira by'abanyamahanga Uwiteka yirukanye imbere y'Abisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yongera kubaka ingoro se Hezekiya yari yarashenye yubaka n'ibicaniro bya Bāli, arema Ashera nk'uko Ahabu umwami w'Abisirayeli yabigenzaga, aramya ingabo zo mu ijuru zose, arazikorera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 7.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yubaka ibicaniro mu nzu y'Uwiteka yari yaravuzeho ati “I Yerusalemu ni ho nzashyira izina ryanjye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi yubakira ingabo zo mu ijuru zose ibicaniro mu bikari byombi by'inzu y'Uwiteka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyuza umuhungu we mu muriro, akajya araguza akaroga, agashikisha abashitsi, akaraguza abapfumu, akora ibyaha byinshi cyane imbere y'Uwiteka ngo amurakaze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.9.3+1KI.9.4+1KI.9.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abami 9.3-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.7.12+2CH.7.13+2CH.7.14+2CH.7.15+2CH.7.16+2CH.7.17+2CH.7.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngoma 7.12-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aremesha igishushanyo cya Ashera kibajwe, agihagarika muri ya nzu Uwiteka yabwiraga Dawidi n'umuhungu we Salomo ati “Muri iyi nzu n'i Yerusalemu, mpatoranije mu miryango yose ya Isirayeli, ni ho nzashyira izina ryanjye iteka ryose.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ati “Sinzongera kuzerereza Abisirayeli ngo mbimure mu gihugu nahaye ba sekuruza babo, niba bazitondera ibyo nabategetse byose, n'amategeko yose umugaragu wanjye Mose yabategetse.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko ntibumvira, ahubwo Manase abashukashuka gukora ibyaha biruta iby'amahanga Uwiteka yarimburiye imbere y'Abisirayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye Uwiteka avugira mu bagaragu be b'abahanuzi ati ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ubwo Manase umwami w'Abayuda akoze ibi bizira, agakora ibibi biruta ibyo Abamori bamubanjirije bakoze byose, akononesha Abayuda ibishushanyo bye bisengwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ni cyo gitumye Uwiteka Imana ya Isirayeli ivuze iti ‘Dore ngiye guteza i Yerusalemu n'i Buyuda ibyago bikomeye, bituma ubyumvise wese yumva amatwi avugamo injereri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nzageresha i Yerusalemu umugozi w'i Samariya, na timazi y'inzu ya Ahabu. Kandi nzahanagura i Yerusalemu nk'uko umuntu ahanagura isahane, yarangiza akayubika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko nzareka igice gisigaye cya gakondo yanjye, mbahāne mu maboko y'ababisha babo, bahinduke umuhigo n'umunyago by'ababisha babo bose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuko bakoze ibyangwa imbere yanjye bakandakaza, uhereye igihe ba sekuruza babo baviriye muri Egiputa na bugingo n'ubu.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Manase yavushije amaraso menshi y'abatacumuye, kugeza aho yayujurije i Yerusalemu hose, akahasanganya, abyongera ku cyaha cye yoheje Abayuda ngo bacumure, bakore ibyangwa n'Uwiteka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko indi mirimo ya Manase n'ibyo yakoze byose n'icyaha yakoze, mbese ntibyanditswe mu gitabo cy'ibyo ku ngoma z'abami b'Abayuda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Manase aratanga asanga ba sekuruza, ahambwa mu murima wo ku rugo rwe wari umurima wa Uza, maze umuhungu we Amoni yima ingoma ye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ibya Amoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amoni yimye amaze imyaka makumyabiri n'ibiri avutse, amara imyaka ibiri i Yerusalemu ari ku ngoma. Nyina yitwaga Meshulemeti mwene Harusi w'i Yotuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko akora ibyangwa n'Uwiteka nk'uko se Manase yakoraga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yagendanaga ingeso zose se yagendanaga, akajya akorera ibishushanyo se yakoreraga, akabiramya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yimūra Uwiteka Imana ya ba sekuruza, ntagendere mu nzira zayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma abagaragu ba Amoni baramugambanira, bamutsinda mu nzu ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze abantu b'icyo gihugu bica abagambaniye Umwami Amoni bose, baherako bimika umuhungu we Yosiya ingoma ye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
